                <p>Source: Comment on instructions to U.S. delegation to nuclear test ban
                    negotiations. Secret. 3 pp. Eisenhower Library, White House Office Files,
                    Additional Records of the Office of the Special Assistant for Science and
                    Technology, Panel-Disarmament-NT-Policy 59.</p>
            </note>
